        <mxCell id="nC" value="count is loaded on entry: S0 = T_green, S1 = T_amber, S2 = T_green, S3 = T_amber.&lt;br&gt;Each road's two 7-seg digits show the remaining time of its own light." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
